[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C15_PARLIAMENT]
Crystal Empire Council

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C15_PARLIAMENT_desc]
The Crystal Empire Council (CEC) is a new political reform initiative of the Crystal Empire, agreed by the three signatories of the Canterlot Pact: the Equestria Empire, the Changeling Empire and the Crystal Empire.
As Princess Cadance was forced to abdicate due to her war crimes, and Flurry Heart was too young to rule the Empire, Empress Cozy Glow proposed that the Crystal Empire should transit from a monarchy to a “limited democracy”: specifically, the affairs of the Crystal Empire should be decided by the CEC, which consists of 500 representative members. The representative members of the Council are re-elected every 6 luna moons, but the monarch and other relevant parties can request an immediate election during non-election periods. The framework stipulates that the representative members should mainly come from the following sources: the Crystal Empire Royals and royal designated members, the Crystal Empire government members and democratically elected representatives, the Equestria Unity Commission, the Changeling Advisory Council, etc.
The issue of the jurisdiction of the CEC is subject to the final interpretation of the Equestria Empire, the Changeling Empire and the Crystal Empire Royals.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C15_PARLIAMENT]
水晶帝国理事会

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C15_PARLIAMENT_desc]
水晶帝国理事会（Crystal Empire Council, CEC）是《坎特洛特协定》体系下，由小马利亚帝国、幻形灵帝国、水晶帝国共同商定的，水晶帝国的政治改革新举措。
由于犯有战争罪的音韵公主被要求退位，而风雪之心年龄尚不足以完全执政，和煦光流女皇提议水晶帝国从君主制过渡到“有限放开的民主制”：具体地，水晶帝国事务将由包含500位代表成员的水晶帝国理事会共同表决决定。理事会代表成员每六个露娜月进行一次重新选举，但在非选举期间君主等等有关权利方可以要求立即进行选举。框架规定，代表成员们应主要来自于以下几个途径：水晶帝国皇室及皇室指定成员、水晶帝国政府成员及民选代表、小马利亚团结委员会、幻形灵顾问团等。
关于理事会所具有的管辖权力如何界定的问题，小马利亚帝国、幻形灵帝国及水晶帝国皇室拥有最终解释权。
